{"payload":{"control_surface":"programmatic_load_dispatch_receipt","counts":{"arbitration":0,"correction":0,"execution":1,"judgment":2,"organize":0,"total":3},"evidence_kind":"live_model","host_transport":"current_agent","method_request_seconds":33.060044042009395,"mode":"route-control.v0.2.1","native_plugin_activation":"not_claimed","original_input":{"authority":{"known_obligations":[],"mode":"read_only","owner_ref":"current-codex:formal-abc-v1","risk":"low"},"dependencies":[{"artifact":"已澄清且可比较的导览方案","condition":null,"consumer":"I2","id":"P1","producer":"I1","refs":[{"document_id":"U1","end":66,"revision":"1","sha256":"313bc2eb752f8729865507ea5c670d519f124c005f8a5431d74fdd1f4d92c2c5","start":0},{"document_id":"U2","end":41,"revision":"1","sha256":"526d079fe132b64778bc26d18ff2751d9174b3f4ab3676c702144a859717d811","start":0}]}],"documents":[{"id":"U1","kind":"user","revision":"1","text":"松岸小型展馆有人主张“要么开发完整导览 App，要么继续只发纸质地图”。请先澄清这个二选一遗漏了什么，提出可按同一标准比较的候选方案"},{"id":"U2","kind":"user","revision":"1","text":"再依据比较结果，建议本期开幕前把有限的人力投向哪里，并说明什么新证据会改变投入决定"},{"id":"S","kind":"source","revision":"1","text":"八站点展览将于 2026 年 11 月 1 日开幕，持续六周，预计每周 600 名参观者。现有纸质地图能标出路线，但近两次活动中约四分之一的受访者表示错过了第三站；展馆已有可编辑的手机网页，尚无 App。三处站点的馆内网络不稳定，前台可继续免费发放纸图。开幕前仅有一名开发者 40 小时、一名内容编辑 24 小时可用；印刷经费上限为 3000 元。参观者使用手机扫码的比例和离线内容的实际需求尚未测量。"}],"episode_id":"formal-abc-v1-HD-C","issues":[{"assessability":null,"attention":true,"candidates":["edsp"],"handling":{"owner_ref":"current-codex:formal-abc-v1","refs":[{"document_id":"U1","end":66,"revision":"1","sha256":"313bc2eb752f8729865507ea5c670d519f124c005f8a5431d74fdd1f4d92c2c5","start":0}],"revision":"1","value":"judge"},"id":"I1","request_ref":{"document_id":"U1","end":66,"revision":"1","sha256":"313bc2eb752f8729865507ea5c670d519f124c005f8a5431d74fdd1f4d92c2c5","start":0}},{"assessability":null,"attention":true,"candidates":["sra"],"handling":{"owner_ref":"current-codex:formal-abc-v1","refs":[{"document_id":"U2","end":41,"revision":"1","sha256":"526d079fe132b64778bc26d18ff2751d9174b3f4ab3676c702144a859717d811","start":0}],"revision":"1","value":"judge"},"id":"I2","request_ref":{"document_id":"U2","end":41,"revision":"1","sha256":"526d079fe132b64778bc26d18ff2751d9174b3f4ab3676c702144a859717d811","start":0}}],"relationship":null,"revision":"1","schema":"mindthus.route-control-input.v1","task_budget":{"max_calls":2,"max_seconds":90},"turn_id":"1"},"outputs":{"I1":{"accepted_uses":{"P1":{"accepted":true,"artifact_sha256":"4b6ec237c35e8c1f984dd9d2379f12f5fe245cd8abf317b0b9c2235ea91fc797","dependency_id":"P1","owner_ref":"current-codex:formal-abc-v1","reason":"Current Codex reviewed I1: paper map, existing web page, their combination, and full App are compared against the same visit, offline and scarce-resource criteria; suitable as I2 candidate input, not an independently verified fact.","source_host_response":"/Users/william/Documents/Codex/2026-09-25/mindthus-formal-abc-v1/HD/episodes/C/turns/391552c099c101b131feaf24c5795a6a15bc8ec82015424e0d2b4274a369a0bf/inputs/8d5eece13f32d8b120091872824788afb09bde2ab10cf7c55356137f2e7845dc/steps/execution__I1__1/host-response.json","source_host_response_sha256":"036f813b21c86a74c305335d8cd4e69b785060f9b6a6cfe00bc59eddaccf17eb"}},"artifact_sha256":"4b6ec237c35e8c1f984dd9d2379f12f5fe245cd8abf317b0b9c2235ea91fc797","methods":["edsp"],"revision":1,"route_id":"fc1fb77f33eb50181a951c451b635fed0b18ac13278c8ae4b20804223e80a7c3","text":"“完整导览 App”与“只发纸图”不是完整的二选一：它遗漏了改进纸图、使用现有手机网页，以及纸图与网页配合的方案。\n\n极限推演后，关键区别是导览能否帮助参观者找到第三站、在断网处能否使用，以及开幕前需要多少制作和维护工作。现有纸图能标路线，但近两次活动约四分之一的受访者表示错过第三站；现有网页可编辑，三处站点网络不稳定，扫码使用率和离线需求尚未测量。这些事实不足以认定 App 或网页一定更有效。\n\n可按同一标准比较五个候选方案：①维持现有纸图，作为基线；②修改纸图，突出第三站及八站路线；③在现有手机网页增加导览内容，保留纸图供断网时使用；④同时改进纸图和网页，并使两者的站点编号、路线一致；⑤开发完整 App，仍提供纸图。对每项均衡量第三站漏访率、八站完成率、断网时可用性、实际使用率，以及开幕前所需开发、编辑和印刷资源。纸图方案无需依赖馆内网络；网页可利用现有基础，但实际采用率未知；App 的制作负担需结合仅有的 40 小时开发时间核实。此处完成方案澄清与比较框架，投入取舍属于后续决定。"}},"pending":{"I2":"applicability_role_unresolved:sra;no_established_primary"},"pending_host_requests":[],"plugin_request_